as possible to save Snackland from the legion of intergalactic robots. But the fun doesn't stop there! Only a limited number of players can work together, and with each round, the game becomes more challenging with more enemies and increasingly difficult obstacles. Immerse yourself in a world of challenges and experiences shared with other players, testing your platforming skills to the fullest. Get ready for thrilling action and collaborative gameplay like never before!", "short_description": "Embark on exciting multiplayer virtual reality competitions. Save Snackland from angry intergalactic robots, racing against time on several challenging courses. Work as a team, overcome obstacles and constantly evolving enemies. Get ready for high-octane action and unparalleled collaborative fun!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://codelabplay.com/privacy-policy-snack-guys", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fernando Dib Gon\u00e7alves", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://codelabplay.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25518236521148164"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304952_1940525550122330_8962949056219766580_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc